  (text "T1S HAT for LilyGO T-ETH-Elite  -  Microchip LAN8651 10BASE-T1S MAC-PHY" (at 30.00 25.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 3.50 3.50) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 0ee16bac-769f-5539-937c-695879485343)
  )
  (text "Every value is from ELECTRICAL.md (Microchip DS60001734F / AN1718 DS60001718D). Single 3.3 V rail: the LAN8651 regulates its own 1.8 V core." (at 30.00 33.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 74c099cd-eb46-53b2-9058-e19ae6b209d7)
  )
  (text "SUPPLY + DECOUPLING   0.1uF and 0.01uF at EVERY power pin, 0.01uF nearest.  FB1..4 are the data sheet's optional supply-island beads, fitted as 0R." (at 30.00 62.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 85a3f9d8-d7d7-54a6-aa97-261689e1ba46)
  )
  (text "FB4 - VDDP pin 17 has its own island (pin 7 is FB3). Both are VDDP; the split is a layout choice." (at 60.00 76.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 03c58e50-30e1-51b7-8486-7371dff64452)
  )
  (text "BUS INTERFACE NETWORK (AN1718 MINIMAL BIN)   CMC - AC coupling - termination - ESD - MDI connector" (at 255.00 85.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid b62d59ac-c720-5341-8f17-1d6523647c31)
  )
  (text "R1/R2 SHIP UNSTUFFED.  Fit 49R9 1% 1W for an END-OF-BUS node, or 1K5 1% for an interior DROP node." (at 255.00 160.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 8f3839e0-75f1-53fa-b7ed-15dc39f29967)
  )
  (text "CLOCK  25.000 MHz, CL 18 pF.  No series and no feedback resistor: the device has ~1 Mohm internally across the amplifier." (at 120.00 228.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 1794fb70-9a60-55c2-b625-f0b4027b3079)
  )
  (text "DIOA0..4 and DIOB0/DIOB1 to ground: the LAN8651 has no LED function.  Status: the Elite's own LED (IO38)." (at 255.00 228.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 850036cd-8be0-565c-8272-2be54d1bcd47)
  )
  (text "PWR_FLAG: these rails are fed through passive pins (header pads, 0R beads), so ERC is told where the supply enters." (at 30.00 248.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 0d9c281f-26c5-5db4-bb48-3b0765a4074d)
  )
